  },
  "question": {
    "text": "Two metallic plates form a parallel plate capacitor. The distance between the plate is &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>&#39;. A metal sheet of thickness <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> and of area equal to area of each plate is introduced between the plates. What will be the ratio of the new capacitance to the original capacitance of the capacitor?<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0077_9a4dbef9ec52.png\" style=\"width: 201px; height: 230px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0077_68215bfb49e5.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 174px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;Before the metal sheet is inserted, capacitance is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></math>.</p><p>After the sheet is inserted, the system is equivalent to two capacitors in series, each of capacitance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>C</mi></math>.<br />The equivalent capacity is now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi></math>.</p><p>The ratio is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
  }
}